{"applicability_conditions":"该式用于热变形过程中饱和应力的定义，基于STG模型；$Z_p$采用峰值应力点$\\sigma_p$处的变形激活能$Q_p$求解。","identity":{"block_id":"b0041","equation_id":"equation_006","equation_number":"6","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {s} = \\sigma_ {\\eta s} \\sinh^ {- 1} \\left[ \\left(\\frac {Z _ {p}}{A _ {s}}\\right) ^ {m _ {s}} \\right] \\text {   and   } Z _ {p} = \\dot {\\varepsilon} \\exp \\left(\\frac {Q _ {p}}{R T}\\right)\\tag{6}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.ijplas.2025.104353"},"latex":"\\sigma_s = \\sigma_{\\eta s} \\sinh^{-1} \\left[ \\left(\\frac{Z_p}{A_s}\\right)^{m_s} \\right] \\text{ and } Z_p = \\dot{\\varepsilon} \\exp\\left(\\frac{Q_p}{RT}\\right)","purpose":"使用STG模型定义饱和应力（saturation stress）$\\sigma_s$，并定义由峰值应力点变形激活能求解的Zener-Hollomon参数$Z_p$（温度补偿应变速率）。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"saturation stress (饱和应力)","symbol":"\\sigma_s","unit":"MPa","value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"material constant of the equivalent thermal component (等效热分量材料常数)","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\eta s}","unit":"MPa","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Zener-Hollomon parameter solved by the deformation activation energy Q_p at the peak stress point; represents the temperature-compensated strain rate (由峰值应力点变形激活能求解的Zener-Hollomon参数，代表温度补偿应变速率)","symbol":"Z_p","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"thermally activated coefficient (热激活系数)","symbol":"A_s","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"thermally activated exponent (热激活指数)","symbol":"m_s","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"strain rate (应变速率)","symbol":"\\dot{\\varepsilon}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"deformation activation energy at the peak stress point (峰值应力点处的变形激活能)","symbol":"Q_p","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"universal gas constant (通用气体常数)","symbol":"R","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"temperature (温度)","symbol":"T","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":[]}